<title>UK: Sumitomo Realty sets 10 bln yen 8-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Realty sets 10 bln yen 8-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUMITOMO REALTY &amp; DEVELOPMENT CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     2.65	MATURITY    13.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.775   PAY DATE  S-28.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.275   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
